.27, " as"], [242.27, 242.47, " in"], [242.47, 242.69, " this"], [242.69, 243.15, " photograph"], [243.15, 243.43, " from"], [243.43, 244.21, " 2012."], [245.49, 245.75, " Since"], [245.75, 246.07, " I"], [246.07, 246.29, " talked"], [246.29, 246.57, " about"], [246.57, 246.83, " the"], [246.83, 247.15, " Copper"], [247.15, 247.55, " Canyons"], [247.55, 248.11, " earlier,"]]}, {"start": 248.27, "end": 256.68, "text": "I think it's only fair that I talk about the Grand Canyon. The clip shows a branch in", "words": [[248.27, 248.47, " I"], [248.47, 248.63, " think"], [248.63, 248.89, " it's"], [248.89, 249.19, " only"], [249.19, 249.65, " fair"], [249.65, 250.03, " that"], [250.03, 250.25, " I"], [250.25, 250.49, " talk"], [250.49, 250.89, " about"], [250.89, 251.21, " the"], [251.21, 251.59, " Grand"], [251.59, 252.03, " Canyon."], [255.34, 255.64, " The"], [255.64, 255.86, " clip"], [255.86, 256.08, " shows"], [256.08, 256.3, " a"], [256.3, 256.5, " branch"], [256.5, 256.68, " in"]]}, {"start": 256.68, "end": 262.34, "text": "the foreground with the canyon blurred behind it, then a hazy wide view. The Grand Canyon is", "words": [[256.68, 257.16, " the"], [257.16, 257.16, " foreground"], [257.16, 257.42, " with"], [257.42, 257.64, " the"], [257.64, 257.92, " canyon"], [257.92, 258.22, " blurred"], [258.22, 258.62, " behind"], [258.62, 258.94, " it,"], [259.22, 259.36, " then"], [259.36, 259.58, " a"], [259.58, 259.94, " hazy"], [259.94, 260.24, " wide"], [260.24, 260.58, " view."], [261.18, 261.32, " The"], [261.32, 261.62, " Grand"], [261.62, 262.02, " Canyon"], [262.02, 262.34, " is"]]}, {"start": 262.34, "end": 271.42, "text": "277 miles, 446 kilometers, long, up to 18 miles wide, and over a mile deep. On the Bright Angel", "words": [[262.34, 263.42, " 277"], [263.42, 263.96, " miles,"], [264.48, 265.3, " 446"], [265.3, 266.06, " kilometers,"], [266.48, 266.92, " long,"], [267.14, 267.32, " up"], [267.32, 267.46, " to"], [267.46, 267.88, " 18"], [267.88, 268.24, " miles"], [268.24, 268.64, " wide,"], [268.98, 269.12, " and"], [269.12, 269.34, " over"], [269.34, 269.5, " a"], [269.5, 269.64, " mile"], [269.64, 269.98, " deep."], [270.6, 270.74, " On"], [270.74, 270.94, " the"], [270.94, 271.14, " Bright"], [271.14, 271.42, " Angel"]]}, {"start": 271.42, "end": 276.66, "text": "Trail, the path is only a thin line of switchbacks down the canyon wall. And at", "words": [[271.42, 271.84, " Trail,"], [272.2, 272.38, " the"], [272.38, 272.64, " path"], [272.64, 272.9, " is"], [272.9, 273.18, " only"], [273.18, 273.42, " a"], [273.42, 273.56, " thin"], [273.56, 273.8, " line"], [273.8, 274.02, " of"], [274.02, 274.5, " switchbacks"], [274.5, 274.84, " down"], [274.84, 275.04, " the"], [275.04, 275.34, " canyon"], [275.34, 275.7, " wall."], [276.34, 276.46, " And"], [276.46, 276.66, " at"]]}, {"start": 276.66, "end": 281.78, "text": "sunset, a single hiker shows the scale, while the rock temples below catch the last light.", "words": [[276.66, 277.08, " sunset,"], [277.3, 277.5, " a"], [277.5, 277.8, " single"], [277.8, 278.18, " hiker"], [278.18, 278.46, " shows"], [278.46, 278.76, " the"], [278.76, 279.14, " scale,"], [279.44, 279.6, " while"], [279.6, 279.8, " the"], [279.8, 280.0, " rock"], [280.0, 280.32, " temples"], [280.32, 280.74, " below"], [280.74, 281.0, " catch"], [281.0, 281.24, " the"], [281.24, 281.5, " last"], [281.5, 281.78, " light."]]}, {"start": 282.68, "end": 289.9, "text": "We are in Nicaragua now, specifically the island of Omatepe in Lake Nicaragua.", "words": [[282.68, 283.4, " We"], [283.4, 283.78, " are"], [283.78, 284.12, " in"], [284.12, 284.78, " Nicaragua"], [284.78, 285.18, " now,"], [285.32, 285.88, " specifically"], [285.88, 286.24, " the"], [286.24, 286.76, " island"], [286.76, 287.18, " of"], [287.18, 287.86, " Omatepe"], [287.86, 288.46, " in"], [288.46, 289.06, " Lake"], [289.06, 289.9, " Nicaragua."]]}, {"start": 293.28, "end": 298.26, "text": "The clip begins with close-ups of leaves and then 